<title>HONG KONG: China Travel 1996 net rises 33.8 pct.</title>
<headline>China Travel 1996 net rises 33.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   13.08    vs  10.42</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	vs  1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    264.45   vs  197.65</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,452.75 vs  991.79</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Travel International</p>
<p>				     Investment Hong Kong Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 16-20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 15</p>
<p>NOTE - China Travel is a unit of mainland tourism conglomerate China Travel Service.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 3.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.5 cents) vs 2.1 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
